title: Constitutional Reform
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: labour_in_government = 1 and attorney_general_party = "Labour" and constitutional_reform_timer = 0 and judicial_reform >= 4 and neorevisionism and ((in_weimar_coalition) or (in_spd_majority) or (in_left_front) or (in_popular_front)) and constitutional_reform < 3
frequency: 25
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; constitutional_reform_timer += 12; pass_threshold = 0.51; pass_threshold = 0.6 if pro_republic < 65;
card-image: img/portraits/RadbruchGustav.jpg
go-to: reforms_menu
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: Major changes to government.

# technically you could do some trickery to get a 2/3 quorum in the Reichstag by stopping some people from attending... if the NSDAP is boycotting the Reichstag, or if the NSDAP or DNVP are banned in the aftermath of a coup atempt...

# alternatively, a constitutional referendum can be initiated, that requires a simple majority of voters to pass (as I understand article 76). This should depend on support for the republic and for democracy, and the relationships with the other parties (more similar to the presidential election).

= Constitutional Reform

# the ideas for constitutional reform here are based on the bundesrepublik basic law... I'm not sure if it's totally realistic to what someone like Mierendorff would've wanted.

Constitutional reform is something we have spoken about for years in opposition, but felt wasn't immediately important upon our ascedence to power. However, now that we have governed for a few years and demonstrated our ability to avert crisis. We believe it is now the time to make some major changes.

There are a few thinsg we have in mind to implement. However, due to the Parliament Act, while the lords cannot veto bills anymore. They can stall the passing of any such bill for up to 2 years. So while we only need a simple majority in the Commons to make any such reform. We will need to remain in power for 2 full years after to be able to invoke the Parliament Act and overide the lords. So we be careful not to be too divisive.

@reforms_menu

- @vote_threshold: Abolish the House of Lords
- @constructive_vonc: Set up regional parliaments for the Welsh and Scottish.
- @presidential_powers: Adopting preportional representation.
- @as_is: Do not pursue constitutional reform.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action
#- @constitutional_bans: Allow the banning of anti-constitutional parties.

@vote_threshold
subtitle: It is an undemocratic tool of the establishment to delay progress!
view-if: electoral_threshold = 0

# The left is opposed to this.

We are now faced with a choice. Do we abolish the lords wholesale and have the House of Commons as a unicameral parliament?

Or should we simply replace the lords with a democratically elected senate?

Both would be a massive shakeup, but the latter is at least less dramatic. And another elected body just means more democracy...right?

- @unicameral: The commons shall be the only authority!
- @create_senate: The lords will be turned into a senate!
- @reforms_menu: See other reform options.


@unicameral
choose-if: reform_support >= pass_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough support for this policy. [? if pro_republic < 65 : We should have an additional margin for the referendum since we need a majority of voters, and many voters who do not support the republic will not participate. ?] [? if z_relation <= 30 : The Center Party does not trust us enough to support this policy. ?]
on-arrival: constitutional_reform += 1; electoral_threshold = 5; liberals_relation -= 25; dvp_relation -= 25; left_dissent += 20; workers_dnvp += workers_other*0.4; workers_nsdap += workers_other*0.4; workers_other *= 0.1; new_middle_dvp += new_middle_other*0.3; new_middle_nsdap += new_middle_other*0.3; new_middle_other *= 0.1; old_middle_dvp += 0.3*old_middle_other; old_middle_nsdap += 0.3*old_middle_other; old_middle_dnvp += 0.3*old_middle_other; old_middle_other *= 0.1; rural_dnvp += 0.5*rural_other; rural_nsdap += 0.4*rural_other; rural_other *= 0.1; unemployed_nsdap += 0.3*unemployed_other; unemployed_kpd += 0.4*unemployed_other; unemployed_other *= 0.2; catholics_z += 0.6*catholics_other; catholics_other *= 0.1;
achievement: verfassungsreform

# this should result in a redistribution of votes - other parties should not get so many votes anymore. maybe ddp and dvp get a recovery of middle-class votes? or maybe they flow to the others.

We have passed a bill to abolish the House of Lords!!! Finally this dragon of bourgeois influence has been slayed! Now the Commons are king, as it should be.

@create_senate
choose-if: reform_support >= pass_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough support for this policy. We need a majority.
on-arrival: constitutional_reform += 1

We have passed a bill to offically reform the House of Lords into a democratically elected senate! This large bastion of bourgeois power is vanquished! If they want power in an upper house now. They will need the peoples will. I wish them good luck, they'll need it!

@constructive_vonc
subtitle: Regional parliaments will finally give the Scots and Welsh autonomy
view-if: constructive_vonc = 0

- @constructive_vonc_2: We pass the bill!
- @reforms_menu: See other reform options.

@constructive_vonc_2
choose-if: reform_support >= pass_threshold
on-arrival: constitutional_reform += 1; constructive_vonc = 1
achievement: verfassungsreform

We've passed the bill. Once the bill passes the lords, we will get work setting up those regional parliaments.

@presidential_powers
subtitle: It would just make our elections more democratic.
view-if: presidential_powers = 0

Preportional Representation would allow each Brit's vote to matter. Currently if you vote labour in a tory area, you vote is meaningless, and vice versa.

While this will make it much more difficult to achieve a majority again. We believe it is worth implementing a more fair system.

- @presidential_powers_2: Pass the bill!
- @reforms_menu: See other reform options.

@presidential_powers_2
choose-if: reform_support >= pass_threshold
on-arrival: constitutional_reform += 1; presidential_powers = 1
achievement: verfassungsreform

We have passed the bill. Once it passes the lords. Thats it. The election after will be under Preportional Representation.



